{
  "schema": "yoyo.swplan/1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "探针 S10：缝合曲面 → **实体**（form_solid 分支）—— 圆台封两盖，体积对 πh/3(R²+Rr+r²)",
    "units": "mm",
    "note": [
      "★ 本探针点名 `surface_knit` 的 **`form_solid=True` 分支**（旧 `surface_knit` 探针只测了 form_solid=False 的缝面）。",
      "★★★ 起因（2026-10-11 真机对照实验）：**`form_solid=True` 少了 `gap_filters=True` 就静默不成实体** ——",
      "   3 张闭合面 knit 后仍是曲面、`n_solid=0`、且 **0 条自由边**（拓扑闭合却不成体）；",
      "   翻成 `gap_filters=True` ⇒ 一次成实体。与容差 0.001/0.01/0.1 无关。",
      "   ⇒ op 的 `gap_filters` 默认已改 True；本探针**故意不传它**，专门锁定这个默认值。",
      "★ 几何：Front 面 r=20 + z=50 面 r=10 两**草图真圆**放样 ⇒ 直圆台（与 `surface_loft` 探针同款几何）。",
      "  解析侧面积 = 30π√2600 = 4805.7127 mm²；解析体积 = πh/3·(R²+Rr+r²) = 36651.9143 mm³。",
      "★ 草图当边界 ⇒ `surface_planar` 拿不到曲线点，必须**显式给 `edge_at`**（这里 (20,0,0)/(10,0,50)）。",
      "★★ 两条真机教训见 30-pitfalls §134：",
      "   ① through-points 曲线的 **3 截面无引导线**放样会**鼓出**（面积 −6.2%、体积 −19%）⇒ 用草图真圆最稳；",
      "   ② 两个**完全相同**的截面放样 ≠ 圆柱（中段缩到 r/√2）。"
    ]
  },
  "params": {},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "n",
      "op": "new_part"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "op": "circle",
      "cx": 0,
      "cy": 0,
      "r": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "s1e",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "SEC0"
    },
    {
      "id": "po",
      "op": "plane_offset",
      "base": "Front",
      "offset": 50,
      "name": "P2"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "P2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "op": "circle",
      "cx": 0,
      "cy": 0,
      "r": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "s2e",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "SEC2"
    },
    {
      "id": "lf",
      "op": "surface_loft",
      "name": "FRUSTUM",
      "sections": [
        "SEC0",
        "SEC2"
      ],
      "closed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cb0",
      "op": "check_body",
      "expect_sheet": 1,
      "expect_solid": 0,
      "expect_area_mm2": 4805.7127,
      "area_tol": 0.005
    },
    {
      "id": "p0",
      "op": "surface_planar",
      "boundary": "SEC0",
      "edge_at": [
        20,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "name": "CAPA"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1c",
      "op": "surface_planar",
      "boundary": "SEC2",
      "edge_at": [
        10,
        0,
        50
      ],
      "name": "CAPB"
    },
    {
      "id": "cbc",
      "op": "check_body",
      "expect_sheet": 3,
      "expect_solid": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "kt",
      "op": "surface_knit",
      "targets": [
        "FRUSTUM",
        "CAPA",
        "CAPB"
      ],
      "tolerance": 0.01,
      "form_solid": true,
      "merge_entities": true,
      "name": "SEW_SOLID"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb1",
      "op": "check_body",
      "expect_sheet": 0,
      "expect_solid": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cm",
      "op": "check_mass",
      "expect_volume_mm3": 36651.9,
      "vol_tol": 0.02
    },
    {
      "id": "bb",
      "op": "check_bbox",
      "expect": [
        40.0,
        40.0,
        50.0
      ],
      "tol_mm": 0.5
    }
  ]
}